         <article data-summary="Truth: what have you copied from AI without checking? Dare: give AI a clearer brief using a made-up task. Your turn." data-tags="fun"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="assets/homepage/activity-landscapes-20260831/girl-talk.png" alt="Truth and Dare card stacks with lavender and pink flip-phone artwork"><div><span class="tag">Truth or dare · with your girls</span><h3>Girl Talk</h3><p>Remember Girl Talk? Truth or dare is back at Delta LAi Nu—with your AI habits on the table. Own up to an AI answer you didn’t check, or practise a clearer brief using a made-up task. Choose a card, decide how far you want to take it, and skip anything you don’t fancy. Your answers stay yours; sharing is up to you.</p><button onclick="location.href='/games/girl-talk.html'">Play Girl Talk</button></div></article>
         <article data-summary="Understand the AI headlines—and what they could mean for your work and life. Check the sources, or explore the bigger issues in The Big Picture." data-tags="help quick"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="assets/town-characters/scenes/paige-newsstand-current-palette-20260823.png" alt="Paige at the NewsStand counter beside her source-checking board"><div><span class="tag">AI news, explained for real life</span><h3>The NewsStand</h3><p>PAiGE breaks down AI headlines so you can understand what happened, why it matters and what it could mean for your work and everyday life. Catch up on the week, or go deeper in The Big Picture, where we examine the bigger issues behind the news. Stories connect the reporting to practical questions in “What This Means For You,” with sources you can follow and check for yourself.</p><button onclick="location.href='/newsstand.html'">Read the NewsStand</button></div></article>
